imum zoom level at","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. The default value is 0."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionminimumzoomlevel","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"title":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesourcedatasource","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Data source for "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":". This protocol defines two optional methods for fetching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, one based on tile coordinates, and one based on a bounding box. Classes that implement this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol must implement one, and only one of the methods. Methods on this protocol will not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called on main thread, they will be called on the caller’s "},{"code":"requestQueue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource":{"title":"MLNComputedShapeSource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNComputedShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"one tile at a time, to be shown on the map on demand. You implement a class"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforming to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that returns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then add a computed shape source to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the computed shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer":{"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionbuffer","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the size of the tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer on each side. A value of 0 produces no buffer. A value of 512 produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer as wide as the tile itself. Larger values produce fewer rendering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artifacts near tile edges and slower performance. The default value is 128."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates":{"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionclipscoordinates","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a Boolean value; specifies whether the shape of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" should be clipped at the edge of each tile. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance":{"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionsimplificationtolerance","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a double; specifies the Douglas-Peucker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simplification tolerance. A greater value produces simpler geometries and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improves performance. The default value is 0.375."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates":{"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionwrapscoordinates","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a Boolean value; specifies whether the shape of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" should be wrapped to accomodate coordinates with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"longitudes beyond −180 and 180. The default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}}}